                      },
                      {
                        "sub": true,
                        "text": "2"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": " is 1:1:1:1 for this reaction, the reactants and the products will always react according to that ratio, so the magnitudes of their concentration changes will be equal."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "qs149cmrq10popz",
                    "type": "p"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Since the products are formed when the reactants are consumed, and vice versa, the concentration changes for the reactants and the products will be in the opposite directions and will therefore have opposite signs."
